@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Strict public-data execution pipeline

start
:Ingest CIC IoT 2023 merged CSV members;
:Build source-file cohorts and synthesize ordering;
note right
Public rows lack row-level victim/device ids
and observed timestamps.
end note

:Split raw rows before windowing\n(train/validation/test);
:Window telemetry and infer flow features;
:Train evidence-generation baselines and artifact-default scorer\nusing flow-derived telemetry only;
note right
Downstream CVE/CVSS, asset-value, and HF
fields are excluded from IDS features.
end note

:Select thresholds on pre-test window;
:Calibrate attack likelihood by isotonic calibration;
:Compute EP from calibrated likelihood\nplus exploitability prior;
note right
Strict public run uses global neutral CVSS prior.
No row-varying exploitability claim.
end note

:Construct risk frame\nAV proxy, EP, IL, HF:none;
:Evaluate base and residual risk;
:Apply scenario-analytic control catalog\n(effectiveness, DR/FPR deltas, TCO terms);
:Run portfolio comparators\nNSGA-II, Greedy-prefix, Exact-ILP;
:Choose artifact-default advisory point\nif a single portfolio is needed;
note right
Selector weights are reporting defaults,
not elicited governance utilities.
end note

:Export tables, plots, validator logs,\nLaTeX summaries, and review templates;
stop
@enduml
